Task: Add caching to build_navigation() and build_search_index(), and skip for HTMX requests

Summary:
- Cached build_navigation() using @lru_cache(maxsize=1) and added clear_navigation_cache() / build_navigation.cache_clear.
- Cached build_search_index() entries by navigation tree id with clear_search_index_cache() / build_search_index.cache_clear.
- Updated get_base_context in views.py to detect HX-Request and skip build_search_index execution entirely for partial HTMX fragment requests.
- Added autouse cache-clearing fixture in tests/conftest.py to prevent test leakage.
- Added dedicated unit tests in tests/test_navigation_cache.py validating cache retention, cache invalidation, and HTMX skipping.

